Do not include glibc's <features.h> on QNX.

<features.h> is glibc's; QNX has none (its feature macros come with every
standard header). datefudge includes it for nothing it uses.

Upstream-Status: QNX-specific
--- a/datefudge.c
+++ b/datefudge.c
@@ -11,7 +11,9 @@
 #include <assert.h>
 #include <dlfcn.h>
 #include <fcntl.h>
+#ifndef __QNX__
 #include <features.h>
+#endif
 #include <stdbool.h>
 #include <stdio.h>
 #include <stdlib.h>
